          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.57"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Tum 57",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.142"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Tum 142",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kupertegha Daudi kanasyanta Kat akïwïnchï kegh köpöno Adulam. Nyini kilïm werkökwa nko katangwa lö kimi wölini, kïpa kutang wölini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kingwïn chi anka tïkwïl wölo mi nyinte nyo kitïng kömpölelyö anta pösön anta ngwonïn ompö mïkulöwunyi, kïlïkwï Daudi yetïntöngwa. Ki pich cho ngata 400 choni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïweghö Daudi atoni kutang Mispa nyo mi Moap, akïlenchï pöytoghinto Moap, “Kaykay osominyi lö nya kungwïn paponyan nko yonyan kïtïpïyö nko nyi, ntökïtenö onkïtwan kïgh nyo ighwanïn Tororöt.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïpïsyï Daudi yiyichi kumpur nko pöytoghinto Moap, kumpur chane nko nyinte ompö osis löwïr cho kiwïngo kegh Daudi köpön.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïlenchï werkoyonta nyo kikuro Kad Daudi, “Mempure köpönonï, wïyö tanga koro Yuda.” Kïwö Daudi kutang wuw pö Eret.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïlïm Saulö lö kikesöwï wölo mi Daudi nko pich walaka cho kimi tïkwïl. Kimi Saulö kïtöpo sankak ghït ompö Kipea ato sïtote akitïng ngotïnyi akimito mötworichi cho kiwit nyinte. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïlenchï Saulö mötworichi cho kighyongo otini mi nyinte, “Atere, pipö Penchamen, kolekwa muköy kïyï le wero Yese kïkonokwa paren nko pareni sapipun akwigh akwa alïkuna yetïntinechi pö lïk, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nka nyï kangalanenanïkwa nyo gha? Amöminye chi nyo kömwowanïn lö kikwam muma Yonatan nko wero Yese. Amöminye chi nyo yonganïn anta mwowanïn lö, mi Daudi kïyöröy pöröyïn atökïparanïn.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïlö Doek nyo pö pipö Edom nyo kighyongöy nko mötwori Saulö, “Kyasïwan wero Yese ato kingwïn kanasyanta Nop, wölo mi Aimelek wero Aitup. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.21.7+1SA.21.8+1SA.21.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1Sam 21:7-9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.52"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Tum 52",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kïtep Aimelek Tororöt kïgh nyo mïchini kwigh Daudi, atolapay kutö nyinte omisyö nko choko Kolyat chichay pö Pilisti.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïyonta Saulö pich, kïkurï tïsin Aimelek wero Aitup nko pikökwa nko tïsï cho kimi Nop, kïpka chane löwïr wölo mi nyinte. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïlö Saulö, “Tera ye nyu, wero Aitup.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïlö Aimelek, “Owöy, we pöytoghin.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïlenchï Saulö nyinte, “Ompö towökanïkwa nko wero Yese atö ketönyi nyinte omisyö nko chok aitepanyi Tororöt kïgh nyo mïchini kwigh nyinte, anyï ye nyu keyokwï möt akïmach kïparanïn?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïlenchï Aimelek Saulö, “Möminye anta nyo ghanate ompö mötworiku le Daudi akep cheptöngu akïwowö ripiku akï konyïtote ompö kongu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Melö asete onkït ato katepan Tororöt kïgh ompö nyinte. Wölo megheghchanïn mötworintengu, we pöytoghin anta piköchan, ompöwölo melö onkïtön ngalechï.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïlö pöytoghintö, “Imeghenyi nyo mötïny, we Aimelek nko pikökwa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïmwochï pöytoghin ripintenyi nyo kighyongo kamasunyi lö, “Para tïsichï pö ECHOTYON, ompöwölo kengarak chane Daudi, kinkït chane lö kiperta Daudi amömwowanïcha.” Wölo kimachamcha mötworichi kïpar tïsi ECHOTYON. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïlenchï Saulö Doek nyo pö pipö Edom, “Para nyo le nyi tïsichï.” Kïpar asisoni Doek tïsï 85 cho kiloköy epod.* ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akïpar pich löwïr cho pö Nop kanasyanta tïsï: mïrön nko kor nko monïng nko tïch nko sïkïröy nko kechir.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wölo kichïwït wero Aimelek wero Aitup akong nyo kïkuro Apyatar akurïp wölo mi Daudi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
